    <system:String x:Key="EffectChain_out_in_Amount_source_For_vocal_isolation_subtrac">out = in − Amount × source. For vocal isolation, subtract the インストゥルメントal from the full song (place that トラック ABOVE this one). Coarse-align the クリップ on the timeline, then tune Align by ear until the インストゥルメントal nulls out. Works best when both are the same master.</system:String>
