    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Add_a_pan_LFO_that_automatically_sweeps_the_trac_Tip">追加 a pan LFO that automatically sweeps the トラック left and right — classic auto-pan for pads, percussion, and spatial movement.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Add_a_reverb_or_delay_return_in_the_mixer_to_cre">追加 a reverb or delay return in the ミキサー to 作成 センドs.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Add_a_send_to_an_existing_return_track_Returns_m_Tip">追加 a センド to an existing return トラック. Returns must be 作成d in the ミキサー (e.g. a Reverb return) before they appear here.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Add_a_volume_LFO_that_rhythmically_raises_and_lo_Tip">追加 a volume LFO that rhythmically raises and lowers トラック level — classic tremolo or pulsing sidechain-style movement without an envelope follower.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Add_pan_LFO">追加 pan LFO</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Add_volume_LFO">追加 volume LFO</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Auxiliary_sends_route_part_of_this_track_to_retu_Tip">Auxiliary センドs — route part of this トラック to return バスes for shared time-based エフェクト (reverb, delay, chorus). 作成 return トラック in the ミキサー first.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Basic_track_identity_and_mix_settings_how_the_tr_Tip">Basic トラック identity and mix 設定 — how the トラック is named, coloured on the timeline, and balanced in the ステレオ or サラウンド field.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Bypass_the_volume_LFO_without_deleting_its_setti_Tip">Bypass the volume LFO without deleting its 設定 — useful for comparing with and without modulation.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_C_LFE">C/LFE</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Center_and_subwoofer_LFE_gains_Tip">Center and subwoofer (LFE) ゲインs.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Center_channel_level_0200_Tip">Center チャンネル level (0–200%).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Channel">チャンネル</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Choose_an_accent_colour_for_this_tracks_header_a_Tip">Choose an accent colour for this トラック's header and lane gutter. Purely visual — use consistent colours across similar トラック types to scan the timeline faster.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Colour">Colour</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Control_how_much_the_LFO_moves_the_fader_Start_a_Tip">Control how much the LFO moves the フェードr. Start around 20–40% for subtle motion; raise for obvious tremolo.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Current_LFO_rate_in_hertz_Tip">Current LFO レート in hertz.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Current_macro_amount_0_bypasses_all_LFO_depth_10_Tip">Current macro amount: 0% bypasses all LFO depth, 100% uses each LFO's full depth setting.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Current_pan_LFO_depth_how_far_pan_swings_from_ce_Tip">Current pan LFO depth — how far pan スウィングs from center (100% reaches hard left/right extremes).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Current_pan_LFO_speed_cycles_per_second_the_pan__Tip">Current pan LFO speed — cycles per second the pan position sweeps left to right.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Current_pan_position_negative_left_0_center_posi_Tip">Current pan position: negative = left, 0 = center, positive = right.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Current_track_fader_level_as_a_percentage_of_uni_Tip">Current トラック フェードr level as a percentage of unity ゲイン (100%).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Current_volume_LFO_depth_as_a_percentage_Tip">Current volume LFO depth as a percentage.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_DRUM_MAP">ドラム マップ</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Depth">Depth</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Drag_the_puck_to_place_the_track_in_the_51_field_Tip">Drag the puck to place the トラック in the 5.1 field. Width (W) controls how diffuse vs. pinpoint the image is — narrow for dialog or lead, wide for pads and ambience.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Drag_to_set_how_loud_this_track_plays_relative_t_Tip">Drag to set how loud this トラック plays relative to other トラック. Affects 再生 and エクスポート; does not change individual クリップ levels.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Drum_maps_translate_MIDI_note_numbers_into_reada_Tip">ドラム マップs translate MIDI ノート numbers into readable ドラム names (Kick, Snare, Hi-hat, etc.) in the piano roll and 記譜. Assign one on インストゥルメント トラック that play ドラム kits.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_EXTERNAL_MIDI">EXTERNAL MIDI</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Edit_the_track_name_This_is_for_organization_onl_Tip">編集 the トラック name. This is for organization only — it does not rename underlying オーディオ ファイルs or MIDI クリップ.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Enable_or_bypass_the_pan_LFO_without_losing_its__Tip">Enable or bypass the pan LFO without losing its レート and depth 設定.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Enable_to_drive_an_external_MIDI_device_from_thi_Tip">Enable to drive an external MIDI デバイス from this トラック. Configure the output port in 設定 → オーディオ/MIDI. Internal インストゥルメントs on the トラック may still play unless removed.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Enabled">有効</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_External_MIDI_routing_sends_this_tracks_notes_an_Tip">External MIDI ルーティング センドs this トラック's ノート and controllers to a hardware synth, ドラム machine, or external plugin host instead of (or alongside) Ongenet's internal インストゥルメントs.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_FL">FL</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_FR">FR</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_FREEZE">フリーズ</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Freeze_is_a_CPU_saving_bounce_Ongenet_renders_ev_Tip">フリーズ is a CPU-saving bounce: Ongenet レンダーs everything on this トラック offline into one オーディオ クリップ so heavy synths and エフェクト no longer run in real time. Your original クリップ, インストゥルメントs, and FX are saved and restored when you unフリーズ.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Freeze_track">フリーズ トラック</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Freeze_track_offline_render_all_clips_instrument_Tip">フリーズ トラック — offline-レンダー all クリップ, インストゥルメントs, MIDI FX, and オーディオ FX on this トラック into a single オーディオ クリップ. 再生back becomes lightweight; the pre-フリーズ state is kept in memory for Unフリーズ.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Front_left_channel_gain_Tip">Front left チャンネル ゲイン.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Front_left_speaker_level_0200_Tip">Front left speaker level (0–200%).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Front_right_channel_gain_Tip">Front right チャンネル ゲイン.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Front_right_speaker_level_0200_Tip">Front right speaker level (0–200%).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Frozen_tracks_play_from_the_bounced_audio_clip_C_Tip">Frozen トラック play from the bounced オーディオ クリップ. クリップ 編集ing, インストゥルメント changes, and エフェクト tweaks are 無効 until you unフリーズ. Mix controls (volume, pan, mute, solo, センドs) still work.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_How_strongly_the_LFO_affects_volume_higher_more__Tip">How strongly the LFO affects volume — higher = more dramatic level change.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_LFO_depth_how_far_volume_deviates_from_the_fader_Tip">LFO depth — how far volume deviates from the フェードr setting. 0% = no エフェクト; 100% = full sweep between silence and double intensity (scaled by Macro).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_LFO_rate_in_Hz_how_many_full_cycles_per_second_t_Tip">LFO レート in Hz — how many full cycles per second the volume sweeps through. Lower = slow swell; higher = fast tremolo.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_LFO_speed_in_cycles_per_second_ignored_when_Sync_Tip">LFO speed in cycles per second (ignored when Sync to tempo is on).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_LFO_waveform_determines_the_shape_of_each_cycle__Tip">LFO waveform — determines the shape of each cycle (smooth sine, linear triangle, abrupt square, etc.).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Lock_LFO_speed_to_the_project_tempo_eg_quarter_n_Tip">Lock LFO speed to the プロジェクト tempo (e.g. quarter-ノート pulses) instead of a fixed Hz レート — keeps modulation musically aligned when BPM changes.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Low_frequency_effects_subwoofer_level_0200_Tip">Low-frequency エフェクト (subwoofer) level (0–200%).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Low_frequency_oscillator_affecting_track_volume__Tip">Low-frequency oscillator affecting トラック volume — 作成s tremolo or rhythmic pulsing.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Low_frequency_oscillator_modulating_stereo_pan_p_Tip">Low-frequency oscillator modulating ステレオ pan position.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_MIDI_channel_on_the_external_port_must_match_the_Tip">MIDI チャンネル on the external port — must match the チャンネル your external synth is set to receive (1–16).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_MODULATION">MODULATION</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Macro">Macro</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Master_depth_control_for_all_track_LFOs_scales_e_Tip">Master depth control for all トラック LFOs — scales every modulator together.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Modulation_macro_one_knob_that_scales_every_LFO__Tip">Modulation macro — one knob that scales every LFO on this トラック. Turn it down to tame all modulation at once during a mix, or up for more dramatic movement.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Move_the_track_in_the_stereo_field_Pan_is_applie_Tip">Move the トラック in the ステレオ field. パン is applied after the トラック フェードr and before センドs and the master バス.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Mute">ミュート</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Mute_silences_this_track_during_playback_and_exp_Tip">ミュート silences this トラック during 再生 and エクスポート without removing its クリップ. Use it to A/B parts or temporarily hide a layer while 編集ing others.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Mute_this_send_without_removing_it_handy_for_A_B_Tip">ミュート this センド without removing it — handy for A/B comparing dry vs. wet or temporarily disabling one エフェクト.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Name">Name</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Override_individual_51_speaker_levels_when_the_m_Tip">Override individual 5.1 speaker levels when the main サラウンド panner is not enough — e.g. boost LFE on a kick-heavy トラック or trim rears on a vocal.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Pan">パン</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Pan_LFO">パン LFO</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Pan_LFO_controls_adjust_rate_and_depth_to_sweep__Tip">パン LFO controls — adjust レート and depth to sweep the トラック across the ステレオ field.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Pan_LFO_depth_how_wide_the_auto_pan_swing_is_Low_Tip">パン LFO depth — how wide the auto-pan スウィング is. Lower values keep motion near center; 100% pans fully across the field.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Pan_LFO_rate_slow_rates_0105_Hz_for_wide_stereo__Tip">パン LFO レート: slow レートs (0.1–0.5 Hz) for wide ステレオ sweeps; faster レートs for jittery movement.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Pan_LFO_rhythmically_moves_the_track_across_the__Tip">パン LFO — rhythmically moves the トラック across the ステレオ field. Pair with a slow レート and modeレート depth for gentle motion, or fast レート for vibrato-like panning.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Per_channel_gains">Per-チャンネル ゲインs</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Pick_the_LFO_shape_sine_triangle_for_smooth_swel_Tip">Pick the LFO shape: sine/triangle for smooth swells, square/saw for hard on/off pumping, random for organic drift.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Pre_fader">Pre-フェードr</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Pre_fader_send_taps_the_signal_before_the_track__Tip">Pre-フェードr センド taps the signal before the トラック フェードr — センド level stays constant even when you ride the トラック volume. Post-フェードr (off) follows フェードr moves.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Rate_Hz">レート (Hz)</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Rear_left_level_0200_Tip">Rear left level (0–200%).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Rear_right_level_0200_Tip">Rear right level (0–200%).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Remove">削除</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Remove_send_Tip">このセンドをトラックから削除</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Send_target_Placeholder">リターントラック…</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Remove_the_pan_LFO_from_this_track_Tip">削除 the pan LFO from this トラック.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Remove_the_volume_LFO_from_this_track_entirely_Tip">削除 the volume LFO from this トラック entirely.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Renders_clips_instruments_and_effects_to_one_aud">レンダーs クリップ, インストゥルメントs, and エフェクト to one オーディオ クリップ to save CPU. Unフリーズ brings back the original 編集able トラック.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Return_track_receiving_this_send_the_aux_bus_whe_Tip">Return トラック receiving this センド — the aux バス where the shared エフェクト chain lives.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Route_to_MIDI_output">Route to MIDI output</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_SENDS">センドS</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_SL_SR_RL_RR">SL/SR/RL/RR</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Scale_all_track_LFO_depths_at_once_Handy_for_rid_Tip">Scale all トラック LFO depths at once. Handy for riding modulation intensity through a song without 編集ing each LFO 分離ly.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Select_a_track_to_edit_its_settings">Select a トラック to 編集 its 設定.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Select_which_drum_map_labels_this_tracks_MIDI_no_Tip">Select which ドラム マップ labels this トラック's MIDI ノート. Choose (none) for melodic インストゥルメントs. 作成 or 編集 マップs in グルーヴ → ドラム マップ エディター.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Send_level_how_much_signal_goes_to_the_return_0__Tip">センド level — how much signal goes to the return. 0% = dry only; higher values add more wet エフェクト from the return トラック.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Send_to_a_return_bus_controls_how_much_of_this_t_Tip">センド to a return バス — controls how much of this トラック feeds a shared エフェクト (reverb, delay, etc.) on that return.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Sends_need_a_destination_return_track_In_the_mix_Tip">センドs need a destination return トラック. In the ミキサー, add a return バス with your reverb or delay chain, then use + here to センド this トラック's オーディオ to it.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Sends_tap_this_tracks_signal_to_return_tracks_au_Tip">センドs tap this トラック's signal to return トラック (aux バスes) for shared エフェクト like reverb and delay. Each センド has its own level and can be pre- or post-フェードr.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Set_how_fast_the_volume_LFO_cycles_Very_low_rate_Tip">Set how fast the volume LFO cycles. Very low レートs (0.05–0.2 Hz) give slow breathing; 4–8 Hz gives vibrato-like tremolo.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Set_the_MIDI_channel_sent_to_the_external_device_Tip">Set the MIDI チャンネル sent to the external デバイス. チャンネル 10 is the conventional 一般 MIDI ドラム チャンネル.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Side_and_rear_surround_channel_gains_Tip">Side and rear サラウンド チャンネル ゲインs.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Side_left_level_0200_Tip">Side left level (0–200%).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Side_right_level_0200_Tip">Side right level (0–200%).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Slow_LFO_on_track_volume_proof_of_concept_modula">Slow LFO on トラック volume (proof-of-concept modulator).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Solo">ソロ</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Solo_isolates_this_track_when_any_track_is_soloe_Tip">ソロ isolates this トラック: when any トラック is soloed, only soloed トラック are heard. Useful for focusing on one part while mixing or checking 編集s.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Stereo_pan_positions_the_track_between_left_and__Tip">ステレオ pan — positions the トラック between left and right speakers. −1 is hard left, 0 is center, +1 is hard right.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Stereo_pan_positions_the_track_between_left_and__Tip_2">ステレオ pan — positions the トラック between left and right speakers.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Surround_51">サラウンド (5.1)</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Surround_panning_for_51_mixes_places_this_track__Tip">サラウンド panning for 5.1 mixes — places this トラック in the immersive field when エクスポートing or モニターing in サラウンド. ステレオ pan still applies; these controls マップ the image to FL, FR, C, LFE, SL, SR, RL, and RR.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Surround_panning_for_51_output_positions_the_tra_Tip">サラウンド panning for 5.1 output — positions the トラック in the immersive speaker layout.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Surround_width_higher_values_spread_the_source_a_Tip">サラウンド width — higher values spread the source across more speakers; lower values keep it tighter and more localized.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Sync_to_tempo">Sync to tempo</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_TRACK">トラック</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Text">+</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_The_label_shown_on_the_timeline_track_header_in__Tip">The label shown on the timeline トラック header, in the ミキサー, and in エクスポート ステム. Renaming does not affect クリップ or ファイル names.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_This_track_is_frozen_only_level_pan_mute_solo_an">This トラック is frozen — only level, pan, mute, solo, and センドs are 編集able until you unフリーズ.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Timeline_colour_helps_you_visually_group_related_Tip">タイムライン colour — helps you visually group related トラック (ドラムs, bass, vocals, etc.) in the arrangement view. Does not affect オーディオ.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Track_Controls_shows_mix_and_routing_settings_fo_Tip">トラック Controls shows mix and ルーティング 設定 for the 選択 timeline トラック — name, mute/solo, level, pan, センドs, グルーヴ, and more. Click any トラック header or lane to load it here.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Track_fader_overall_output_level_after_clip_gain_Tip">トラック フェードr — overall output level after クリップ ゲイン and before master バス processing. 100% is unity ゲイン; lower values attenuate the whole トラック.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Track_fader_overall_output_level_after_clip_gain_Tip_2">トラック フェードr — overall output level after クリップ ゲイン and before master バス processing.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Track_freeze_temporarily_converts_a_track_to_aud_Tip">トラック フリーズ — temporarily converts a トラック to オーディオ so 再生 uses less CPU. Use it when a finished part has expensive インストゥルメントs or エフェクト but you still need to hear it while mixing the rest of the song.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Track_modulation_applies_automatic_movement_to_m_Tip">トラック modulation applies automatic movement to mix パラメーター — LFOs that swell volume or sweep pan over time. Useful for tremolo, auto-pan, and subtle motion without drawing オートメーション.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Typical_workflow_finish_writing_on_a_CPU_heavy_t_Tip">Typical workflow: finish writing on a CPU-heavy トラック, フリーズ it, then mix バスes and add more layers without dropouts. While frozen you cannot 編集 クリップ, インストゥルメントs, or エフェクト — click Unフリーズ to resume 編集ing.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Unfreeze">Unフリーズ</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Unfreeze_discard_the_frozen_audio_clip_and_resto_Tip">Unフリーズ — discard the frozen オーディオ クリップ and restore the original クリップ, インストゥルメントs, and エフェクト exactly as they were before フリーズ. Use this when you need to tweak the part aゲイン.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Volume">音量</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Volume_LFO">音量 LFO</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Volume_LFO_cyclically_modulates_track_level_Adju_Tip">音量 LFO — cyclically modulates トラック level. Adjust レート for speed, depth for intensity, and waveform for character (smooth sine vs. choppy square).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Volume_LFOs_repeat_a_cyclic_level_change_tremolo_Tip">音量 LFOs repeat a cyclic level change (tremolo). Sync to tempo for musical pulses, or run free in Hz for organic drift.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_W">W=</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_Wave">Wave</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_none">(none)</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TrackInspector_none_Placeholder">(none)</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TransportAction_PlayPause">再生 / 一時停止</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TransportAction_Record">録音</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TransportAction_Stop">停止</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Add_arrangement_marker_at_playhead_Tip">追加 arrangement marker at playhead</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Adjust_master_output_level">Adjust master output level</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Adjust_master_output_level_A11yHelp">Adjust master output level</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Arrangement_Session_or_Hybrid_playback_Tip">Arrangement, セッション, or Hybrid 再生</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_BPM">BPM</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Bars">Bars</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Beats_per_bar_Right_click_to_automate_on_the_mas_Tip">Beats per bar. Right-click to automate on the master トラック.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Cap_MIDI">Cap MIDI</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Capture_recently_played_MIDI_into_a_clip_at_the__Tip">Capture recently played MIDI into a クリップ at the playhead</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Clear_punch">Clear punch</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Click">Click</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Enable_Ableton_Link_tempo_phase_sync_Tip">Enable Ableton Link tempo/phase sync</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Export">エクスポート</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Export_A11yName">エクスポート</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Export_all_instrument_track_MIDI_to_a_mid_file_Tip">エクスポート all インストゥルメント-トラック MIDI to a .mid ファイル</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Export_master_stems_or_a_beat_region_16_24_32_bi_Tip">エクスポート master, ステム, or a beat region (16/24/32-bit WAV)</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Global_key_root_for_scale_snapping_in_the_piano__Tip">Global key root for scale snapping in the piano roll</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Global_scale_mode_for_the_piano_roll_Tip">Global scale/mode for the piano roll</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Go_to_next_marker_Tip">Go to next marker</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Go_to_previous_marker_Tip">Go to previous marker</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Key">Key</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Loop_rec">ループ rec</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Loop_recording_restart_at_loop_end_Tip">ループ 録音 — restart at loop end</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_Loop_region_active_Tip">ループ region active</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_M">M+</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_MIDI">MIDI</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Transport_M_2">M→</system:String>
